Changes made in this directory:
  - Notebooks trimmed to their Exercises sections.
  - Setup code reduced to only the cells the exercises depend on.
  - Display-only calls removed from retained setup code.
  - Exercise solutions written by Arya Kadakia.

The exercise solutions are original work by Arya Kadakia and are, per the
ShareAlike term, also released under CC BY-SA 4.0 as part of these adapted
notebooks.

